From: xiaobao <xiaobao@local>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: rockchip: sai: fix default SAI_PATH_SEL to lane0->SDO2

Neardi LK3576 (RK3576) ES8323 codec is physically wired to the
sai1m0_sdo2 pin. The upstream reg_default for SAI_PATH_SEL is 0x0000e4e4,
which routes transmit lane0 to SDO0 — where no codec is connected — so
3.5mm playback is silent.

The RK3576 hardware reset default of SAI_PATH_SEL is 0x0000e4e6
(lane0 -> SDO2), which is exactly the routing used by the working
Android 14 BSP DT (it does not set rockchip,sai-tx-route at all and
relies on the silicon default). Align the reg_default with the hardware
reset value so the codec receives I2S data without requiring an explicit
sai-tx-route in every board DT.

Verification on LZ200: with this default, /sys/kernel/debug/regmap/
2a610000.sai/registers offset 0x38 reads 0x0000e4e6 and 1kHz playback
reaches the 3.5mm jack.

Signed-off-by: xiaobao <xiaobao@local>
---
 sound/soc/rockchip/rockchip_sai.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/rockchip/rockchip_sai.c b/sound/soc/rockchip/rockchip_sai.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/sound/soc/rockchip/rockchip_sai.c
+++ b/sound/soc/rockchip/rockchip_sai.c
@@ -1345,7 +1345,7 @@ static const struct reg_default rockchip_sai_reg_defaults[] = {
 	{ SAI_TXCR, 0x00000bff },
 	{ SAI_FSCR, 0x0001f03f },
 	{ SAI_RXCR, 0x00000bff },
-	{ SAI_PATH_SEL, 0x0000e4e4 },
+	{ SAI_PATH_SEL, 0x0000e4e6 },
 };
 
 static const struct regmap_config rockchip_sai_regmap_config = {
-- 
